 It's got a continue in it.

00:11:39.040 --> 00:11:43.480
 And so it is kind of a nontrivial piece of code,

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:45.520
 the smallest nontrivial piece of code

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:50.280
 that I could fit into this particular emulator on a screen

